  "methods": {
    "episode": "One fixed recovery trial: retain v5 evidence inside a body-attack episode.\n\nStart on body fast/slow >2 after rearm (<1.2), collect balance and combined rise\nfor at most35ms, and require two adjacent body-attack hops. A return below1.2\nends the episode. Original v5 eligibility is always retained. This is not the\nprevious unrestricted temporal-predicate accumulator. No threshold sweep.\n",
    "continuity": {
      "description": "Measure a fixed causal AR veto for the frozen sustained-bass fires.\n\nThis is a CPU-only development measurement.  The predictor is fit on the 80 ms\nimmediately before a 20 ms evaluation window, using only past samples.  A fire\nis vetoed when residual energy is at most 10 percent of observed energy.",
      "settings": {
        "predictor": "zero-intercept order-8 linear autoregression",
        "train_window_s": 0.08,
        "evaluation_window_s": 0.02,
        "ridge_relative_to_mean_xtx_diagonal": 0.001,
        "veto_score_max": 0.1,
        "insufficient_history": "unassessed/keep",
        "silence": "unassessed/keep"
      }
    }
  },
  "findings": [
    "Event-scoped evidence retention recovers the visually labelled Inhale Exhale12.620s kick. Wider-associated label count105\u2192106, unmatched events40\u219252; no old associated labels lost.",
    "Strict50ms matches102\u2192105 include the Inhale recovery, a Feel hit moving inside50ms, and a Midnight trigger45.333ms before a label. The latter fails the fixed35ms early allowance; do not present all3as newly recovered kicks.",
    "Most missed Late Night and Midnight kicks do not show the required combined power rise inside the examined35ms interval; retaining nonexistent evidence cannot rescue them. This is a diagnostic observation with provisional labels, not a DSP impossibility claim.",
    "AR continuity rejects81of105wider-associated kicks while removing32of40unmatched fires. One-step predictability also applies to short tonal kicks; this fixed score does not establish bass identity. No threshold tuned."
  ],
  "verification": {
    "episode_tests": 4,
    "continuity_tests": 4,
    "native_and_improved_references_replayed_per_trial": 7,
    "continuity_kept_hops_verified_against_each_event_decision": true
  },
  "limitations": [
    "Development-only sequential experiments with global settings. Provisional visual event labels and qualitative listening feedback; no new labels.",
    "No changes to app, frozen improved reference, output timing tolerances, or held-out Miracle/Heavy On Mind recordings.",
    "All decisions use recorded available hop time. Continuity filter/predictor CPU throughput is not a native callback or perceptual latency guarantee."
  ],
